  "ingredients": [
    "1.3333300352097 cups packed brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup shortening",
    "1 egg",
    "2 cups sifted all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1 cup chopped walnuts",
    "1 cup apples - peeled, cored and finely diced",
    "1 cup raisins",
    "0.25 cup milk",
    "1.5 cups sifted confectioners' sugar",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2.5 tablespoons half-and-half cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat brown sugar and butter together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy; beat in egg until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ffTP-HNonwM-WA2cFOBvfAwowXA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-02-9774f2e33bc24b979f58bb7680b9c500.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking soda, salt, cinnamon, cloves, and nutmeg in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u7KwnzvfOZlV7OFAGlKUay0ueF0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-03-e1b1b610c5cd499c9da3726e8c4c9435.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir 1/2 of the flour mixture into brown sugar mixture. Stir in nuts, apple and raisins, then stir in remaining flour mixture and milk. Mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9V6EhAqpf72Du5g6mhmqyHCHkuw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-04-10b7b6764c5a4a2b875e673e05c1a21d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop spoonfuls of dough 2 inches apart onto the prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xYVcD8YPoY3gkd-KSWXXpiX0cIg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-05-ca06728159964af091d6b9a761bd531c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are golden, about 10 to 12 minutes. Remove cookies to racks to cool slightly while you make the glaze.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kg3tosdo451_n0jkE4aQZqPMeJc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-06-bd4163eb432b4de6b8ba22ee25323a4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the glaze: Beat powdered sugar, butter, vanilla, and enough cream to make glaze of spreading consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7bQumkt3ZYRdSzyUn0e1Nks_q4o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-07-140141e07ccb4eb397c721d6d6427000.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread or drizzle on warm cookies. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xa7MXZElp1Bx3-OgPMpZyyBVYbE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9768-glazed-apple-cookies-VAT-step-08-a046e572da21485bb9b475a30fa8d70b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9768/step_08.webp"
    }
